# Token-ops inventory — authoritative list of every ERC20 token-moving call
# site in production `src/`. Every new `transfer` / `transferFrom` /
# `safeTransfer` / `safeTransferFrom` call merged into `src/` must be added
# here (file:line) with the spec rule that upholds its invariant, or the
# lint-token-ops.sh gate will refuse the merge.
#
# Format: `<path>:<line> | <caller> | <spec coverage>`
# Blank lines and `#` comments are ignored.
#
# Spec coverage column lists the CVL rule(s) in certora/TokenOpsVerification.spec
# (or a sister spec) that prove the call's invariant. Pending entries are
# marked `[PENDING: <spec target>]` — new entries MAY ship pending, but must
# be followed by a spec PR within the same sprint.

src/FigaroCore.sol:132 | _pullExact (commit bond pull) | commitBuyerExactDelta, commitSellerExactDelta, commitContractExactDelta, commitAllowanceDrainSafety, commitTokenConservation
src/FigaroCore.sol:293 | resolveProcess (seller payout) | resolveSingleOrderPayout, resolveSingleOrderConservation
src/FigaroCore.sol:294 | resolveProcess (buyer payout)  | resolveSingleOrderPayout, resolveSingleOrderConservation

# WitnessSwapAndCommitCoordinator — the swap-and-commit coordinator (its unhardened
# predecessor, which left the swap route outside every signature, was deleted before
# any deployment — git history). TRACKED here: the swap route is bound into a
# Permit2 witness, so its token movements are an accounted surface even before it is
# UI-wired. SECURITY NOTE: still pre-production — no CVL rule proves these yet, so both
# ship [PENDING]. Both forward swapped bond currency / unconsumed input to the party
# (`c.buyer`/`c.seller`); neither touches kernel escrow (the kernel pulls the bond
# itself). Spec target: a CoordinatorTokenConservation rule proving the coordinator
# retains no bond currency or input token after `swapAndCommit` (asserted by the
# `SlippageResidualStaysWithParty` / `InputResidualRefunded` Foundry tests today).
src/WitnessSwapAndCommitCoordinator.sol:231 | _fund (bond currency → party) | [PENDING: CoordinatorTokenConservation — coordinator retains no bond currency post-swap]
src/WitnessSwapAndCommitCoordinator.sol:235 | _fund (input residual refund → party) | [PENDING: CoordinatorTokenConservation — coordinator retains no input residual]

# FigaroBatchVerifier — the batch-settlement verifier (proof-apparatus
# rebuild). BatchVerifierTokenOps.spec is realigned to the witness model
# (7-word PV, specBindings, contentHashOf summarized as a revert-only view);
# the cloud run needs the operator's CERTORAKEY — both entries stay [PENDING]
# until that run's results table is green.
src/FigaroBatchVerifier.sol:339 | _executePositions (net payout → user) | [PENDING: BatchVerifierTokenOps cloud run — needs CERTORAKEY; spec realigned]
src/FigaroBatchVerifier.sol:349 | _pullExact (net deposit pull) | [PENDING: BatchVerifierTokenOps cloud run — needs CERTORAKEY; spec realigned]
